WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.970
You are standing in the
corner of a playground.

2
00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.810
You walk three metres along one edge.

3
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:09.790
Then you turn through a right
angle, and walk four metres.

4
00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.530
You have walked seven metres in total.

5
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:14.850
Now look back at where you started.

6
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.470
How far away is it in a straight line?

7
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.310
Is the shortcut seven metres too?

8
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.730
Or less?

9
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.450
And how much less?

10
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.620
In this mission, you'll name
shapes by their properties.

11
00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:29.390
You'll flip, turn and
slide shapes on a grid.

12
00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:33.770
And you'll meet Pythagoras' theorem,
for right-angled triangles.

13
00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.130
Your mission: find the
length of the shortcut.
